     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><div>\r\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #e1e1e1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Adams, Dean [EEOBS]<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Monday, August 14, 2017 1:11 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">klb...@gmail.com</a>; geomorph R package &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> RE: [geomorph-r-package] Re: NA values returned for estimate.missing<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Hi Karen,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">That is curious indeed. If you could send me the file and the script I’ll look into it.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dean<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Dr. Dean C. Adams<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Professor<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Department of Ecology, Evolution, and Organismal Biology<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">       Department of Statistics<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">Iowa State University<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486065948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2eN94MvCgILoyAeBkvHNB_\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:purple\">www.public.iastate.edu/~dcadams/</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\">phone: <a href=\"tel:(515)%20294-3834\" value=\"+15152943834\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">515-294-3834</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n</span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> [</span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">mailto:geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b></span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">klb...@gmail.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Monday, August 14, 2017 12:23 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> geomorph R package &lt;</span><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">geomorph-...@googlegroups.com</span></a><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [geomorph-r-package] Re: NA values returned for estimate.missing<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Hi Emma,</span><u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I did as you suggest. The dimensions look correct: 57 3 8. There are 8 individuals with 57 3D landmarks. I created a similar file with different specimens and read it in using\r\n readland.nts and it worked fine with the estimate.missing function, so I don&#39;t think that&#39;s the issue. <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">I also plotted the original data in Morpheus (which allows missing landmarks) and it looks fine visually. I&#39;d be happy to share the &quot;Homo_MD.nts&quot; file if that&#39;s possible / helpful.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">What&#39;s particularly strange is that it does in fact estimate the missing landmarks, but in 2D. I dropped the z coordinate (the NA values) and plotted the offending specimen, and\r\n it looks fine. It&#39;s just not doing it in 3D<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br>\r\nThanks,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:9.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"><br>\r\nKaren<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;geomorph R package&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">geomorph-r-pack...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\ngeomorph-...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nVisit this group at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486065948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mnj6343mojqkzyTJ89cuR\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/group/geomorph-r-package</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/e978e82d-d5e3-476e-a5c4-1297124419ac%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/e978e82d-d5e3-476e-a5c4-1297124419ac%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486065948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-lW9F1kRfOOQD7nlesLQp\">\r\nhttps://groups.google.com/d/msgid/geomorph-r-package/e978e82d-d5e3-476e-a5c4-1297124419ac%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792486065948000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1w7q3NYgpDYTL_p4Kxq-IU\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div></div>"
